        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: International Grenfell Association\n- People: Sir Wilfred Thomason Grenfell\n- Places: Newfoundland, Labrador, northern Newfoundland\n- Roles: medical missionary\n- Topics: health care, education, religious services, rehabilitation, social services\n\nFacts:\n- Sir Wilfred Thomason Grenfell was born on 28 February 1865 and died on 9 October 1940.\n- Sir Wilfred Thomason Grenfell was a medical missionary to Newfoundland and Labrador.\n- Sir Wilfred Thomason Grenfell founded the International Grenfell Association.\n- The International Grenfell Association provided health care, education, religious services, rehabilitation, and other social activities.\n- The International Grenfell Association served fisherman and coastal communities in northern Newfoundland and along the coast of Labrador.",
